<title>JAPAN: JT says to make announcement on AIDS drug project.</title>
<headline>JT says to make announcement on AIDS drug project.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Tobacco Inc said on Friday it plans to make an announcement at 2 a.m. on Saturday (1700 GMT Friday) in both Japan and the United States on its joint development of an AIDS drug with Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
<p>JT declined to provide further details.</p>
</text>
